# Template for this Worker's secrets. Real values are never committed — every
# copy destination below is gitignored.
#
#   Local dev:  cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars       # read by `wrangler dev` + vitest
#   Deploys:    cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars.production  (and .dev.vars.staging),
#               fill in that environment's values, then push them with
#               scripts/put-secrets.sh <env>  (npm run secrets / secrets:staging)
#
# Declare one KEY= line per secret. A line ending in "# optional" is pushed
# only when non-empty; every other declared secret is validated before
# anything is pushed. Non-secret per-environment config belongs in
# wrangler.toml [vars], not here.
#
# Bearer token for POST /api/refresh (npm run refresh). Also set as a Worker secret.
REFRESH_SECRET=
